    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bash_detail",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 608,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "1. AST parse (tree-sitter)\n2. Pattern matching (blocklist)\n3. Semantic analysis (pipes, redirects)\n4. Path traversal detection\n5. Environment variable expansion\n6. Process substitution check\n\nEach validator: allow | deny | needs_confirmation",
      "originalText": "1. AST parse (tree-sitter)\n2. Pattern matching (blocklist)\n3. Semantic analysis (pipes, redirects)\n4. Path traversal detection\n5. Environment variable expansion\n6. Process substitution check\n\nEach validator: allow | deny | needs_confirmation",
